  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "0.25 cup diced onion",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon white sugar",
    "3 (14.5 ounce) cans French-style green beans, drained",
    "2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "0.5 cup crumbled buttery round crackers",
    "1 tablespoon butter, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NkimMDnKZBUZdTDCRz937ekPyF4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13717-grandmas-green-bean-casserole-ddmfs-step-01-1c48fdbfeaaa46f1bc4313a39cd88e33.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13717/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the green beans: Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Stir in flour until smooth, and cook for 1 minute. Stir in sour cream, onion, salt, and sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_U2gGXYePXP6XzNjgCbcnUnMbGk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13717-grandmas-green-bean-casserole-ddmfs-step-02-65050b435ea740f6b8a79a782014552e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13717/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add green beans, and stir to coat. Transfer green bean mixture to a 2 ½-quart casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qvrZwQLYNV0GGdRTydIdDiPz5Fo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13717-grandmas-green-bean-casserole-ddmfs-step-03-69a61c0270e94c258e70ae90d7f6e4fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13717/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread Cheddar cheese over green bean mixture. Toss cracker crumbs and melted butter together in a small bowl; sprinkle over bean mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ABX_p2UyAfoLihkyVh87NQjL8cs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13717-grandmas-green-bean-casserole-ddmfs-step-04-24cda67c47cd43a1b0e47ff9403eebf2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13717/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until topping is golden and cheese is bubbly, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Nm7mkazV44uiG3j2GP7rDz6zgmw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13717-grandmas-green-bean-casserole-ddmfs-step-05-3d55826c72534591944ca2e1671360b4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13717/step_05.webp"
